# Dev-only wallet shim config (see src/devwallet.ts).
#
# Optional. Used only when the app is opened with `?dev-wallet=1` in the URL,
# or by scripts/publish-real-price.mjs (it needs the authorized updater key to
# broadcast an oracle price update).
# Point it at the disposable MONAD TESTNET key used by the spike/core scripts
# (spike/.env) so reads, previews and tx-failure flows run against real
# balances on-chain.
#
#   VITE_DEV_WALLET_KEY=0x...
#
# Never put a real private key here, and never enable this in production.
#
# RPC endpoints (optional overrides). The app reads/broadcasts through
# lib/provider.ts, which retries each request across PRIMARY → FALLBACK with a
# per-attempt timeout, because the default public Monad RPC is intermittently
# slow/unreachable (requests hang or die at the TCP level → "Failed to fetch").
# Point these at any chain-10143 JSON-RPC endpoint:
#
#   VITE_RPC_URL=https://testnet-rpc.monad.xyz
#   VITE_RPC_FALLBACK_URL=https://monad-testnet.drpc.org
#